nderstanding\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJacobDevlin\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMing-WeiChang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKentonLee\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKristinaToutanova\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tProceedings of the 2019 Conference of the North American Chapter\n\t\tthe 2019 Conference of the North American Chapter\n\t\t\n\t\t\tthe Association for Computational Linguistics\n\t\t\t2019","doi":null,"arxiv_id":null,"title":"Bert: Pre-training of deep bidirectional transformers for language understanding","anchors":[{"ref_id":"b6","section_path_id":"1","quote":"(Devlin et al., 2019)","offset":4374}]},{"raw_text":"YuxiangWu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDominikSchmidt\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tZhengyaoJiang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2024","doi":null,"arxiv_id":null,"title":null,"anchors":[]},{"raw_text":"An image is worth 16x16 words: Transformers for image recognition at scale\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAlexeyDosovitskiy\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tLucasBeyer\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAlexanderKolesnikov\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDirkWeissenborn\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tXiaohuaZhai\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tThomasUnterthiner\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMostafaDehghani\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMatthiasMinderer\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tGeorgHeigold\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSylvainGelly\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tInternational Conference on Learning Representations\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2020","doi":null,"arxiv_id":null,"title":"An image is worth 16x16 words: Transformers for image recognition at scale","anchors":[]},{"raw_text":"AbhimanyuDubey\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAbhinavJauhri\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAbhinavPandey\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAbhishekKadian\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAhmadAl-Dahle\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAieshaLetman\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAkhilMathur\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAlanSchelten\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAmyYang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAngelaFan\n\t\t\n\t\tarXiv:2407.21783\n\t\tThe llama 3 herd of models\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2024\n\t\t\n\t\n\tarXiv preprint","doi":null,"arxiv_id":"2407.21783","title":null,"anchors":[{"ref_id":"b9","section_path_id":"1","quote":"Dubey et al., 2024)","offset":82}]},{"raw_text":"TaoHan\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tZhenghaoChen\n\t\t\n